sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant IDX as index.js
  participant BOO as bootstrap.js
  participant MIG as migrate.js
  participant AIV as PostgreSQL Aiven
  IDX->>IDX: app.listen<br/>(buka port lebih dulu)
  loop sampai 40 kali, jeda 5 detik
    IDX->>BOO: bootstrap()
    BOO->>MIG: migrate()
    MIG->>AIV: koneksi TLS (pool pg)
    MIG->>AIV: pg_advisory_lock 727201
    MIG->>AIV: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS<br/>schema_migrations
    MIG->>AIV: jalankan berkas sql yang<br/>belum tercatat (transaksi)
    MIG->>AIV: pg_advisory_unlock
    BOO->>AIV: seed site, pengaturan,<br/>daftar cek, unit, admin awal
    alt galat
      BOO-->>IDX: error, coba lagi
    else sukses
      BOO-->>IDX: selesai, state.ready true
    end
  end
